        <li><strong>Progressive difficulty</strong> — easy puzzles teach you the rules; hard puzzles push your reasoning to the limit.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>GridPaw (Akari) checks all three boxes — plus it adds a cozy cat theme that makes the puzzle feel like a warm cup of tea rather than an exam.</p>

